    "hash": "d74035e30e",
    "en": "Zuljin is the Warlord of the Amani forest Trolls. A powerful and fierce troll, Zul'jin has an immense hatred towards the High Elves of Quel'thalas, and this hatred led him into seeking unlikely allies in the form of outlandish invading Orcs.\n|n|cffffcc00Attacks land and air units.|r",
